      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc006_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "对，刚刚来了一个比较急的事情。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc006_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "需要今天完成吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
